{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Description</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every night, <strong>the nightmare begins.</strong><br>Your room is no longer a safe place\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The moment you lie down on a strange bed and close your eyes\u2014<br>you are <strong>no longer alone.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is this reality?<br>Or are you trapped inside someone else\u2019s nightmare?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>That game you\u2019ve seen somewhere before \u2014 now on Steam!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run from terrifying monsters and <strong>hide in safe rooms to survive.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lie on your bed to earn money, then <strong>build turrets to fight back against vengeful monsters.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tap empty floor tiles to <strong>open the building menu.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place buildings strategically and manage your resources wisely to <strong>survive as long as possible.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As time passes, the tension keeps rising,<br>and <strong>new strategies and upgrades become the key to survival.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stop the monsters and you win.<br>But if they catch you\u2026 it\u2019s over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take Control of Your Nightmare</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t fear the nightmare.<br>It might be the <strong>perfect way to blow off some stress.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome the challenge and prove that<br><strong>you can wake up from this nightmare.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cThe moment you lie down on the bed\u2026 everything begins.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you escape this nightmare?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\